# Model files live here at runtime. None are checked in.
#
# Required files (see README "Setting up the models"):
#
#   asl_classifier.onnx      - alphabet MLP (~250 KB)
#   model_meta.json          - alphabet label map + metadata
#   reference_landmarks.json - per-letter mean landmarks for the 3D preview
#
# Optional (phrase transcription):
#
#   asl_ctc.onnx             - CTC transformer (~116 MB)
#   asl_ctc_meta.json        - CTC label map + metadata
#
# All of these come out of openhand-model's exports/. See the
# openhand-model README for how to train them, or grab a release bundle
# from the project's GitHub releases page.
